{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/V_N2G8mtglCN40RMrF8jVA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:17.269277+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/V_N2G8mtglCN40RMrF8jVA","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>量子科学与精密测量研究院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含本科直博）预报名通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>根据学校2027年推免工作相关要求，现将量子科学与精密测量研究院推免预报名工作有关事项通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/FUbvnBCEOQsfxatg7JHVqfaOdgKibIjO8w1BicSFYTu1kW15gBGHAE2icKMNCsicCPC7fcHG1ufiaNKzgF5TF3wubSvh40XkIYN3sg5ukQ6F375s/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法、品德良好；</span></p><p><span>2. 已获得或预计获得就读学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>3. 学习成绩优异，具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质和专业基础；</span></p><p><span>4. 诚实守信，学风端正，无任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></p><p><span>5. 身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生学科</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/FUbvnBCEOQuE6p2mgPdxa0LibaiaBENEUUJHicISXtib7rlVC6FUMjjBt66CN3kfdmCXcfK0IjK5Qeu47sYicodmvH1zCSeuO3gO6pODlLaicyFkI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>研究院2027年推免招生学科如下：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/FUbvnBCEOQvg2FsrDXkibhNa2uGuUicoTnEsu2ZznpDkNWOQPqoUMctPg4ib3N9hDfPqGV2SOWr1yO1Yy5GkTEO8CSVbQ3Au8C1aJgWyoAibYAU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>备注：推免招生计划以学校后续正式公布为准，请及时关注。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/FUbvnBCEOQvJ6BaFFGOJlCcUaSpTc7PDNSKmusiaBalmjszDBSjT1lkAuS8gibwAy2IAs9kp9qHc1PLvFetdOErQRtNrm80UBjpV3V4e7xxbY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间及方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 研究院鼓励优秀推免生直接攻读博士学位，并推出系列举措支持学业；</span></p><p><span>2. 研究院通过华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统（网址：</span><strong><span><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5</span></span></strong><span>，以下简称“学校报考系统”）接受预报名；</span></p><p><span>3. </span><span><strong><span>研究院推免预报名截止时间为：2026年9月10日23:00</span></strong></span><span>；</span></p><p><span>4. 错过预报名但仍有意报考量子科学与精密测量研究院的推免生，可在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”(网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm，以下简称“教育部推免系统”)开放后在教育部推免系统中直接报名。研究院将根据实际情况，确定是否再次组织复试，届时请密切关注我院公告、通知。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名材料</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 有效居民身份证；</span></p><p><span>2. 教育部学籍在线验证报告；</span></p><p><span>3. 预报名申请表（报名系统填写完毕后下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></p><p><span>4. 诚信承诺书（报名系统下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></p><p><span>5. 本科成绩单（前6学期）1份，加盖学校教务处（本科生院）或院系公章；</span></p><p><span>6. 本科综合/专业排名证明1份，需写明申请人所在年级/班级/专业总人数及申请人目前排名，并加盖学校教务处（本科生院）或院系公章；</span></p><p><span>7. 推免资格证明（如有，请加盖学校或院系公章，证明申请人已获或有望获得推免资格）；</span></p><p><span>8. 外语水平证明材料（如英语四级、六级、托福、雅思等成绩单原件扫描件）；</span></p><p><span>9. 申请硕士生/直博生须提交1封副教授及以上职称专家出具的推荐信；</span></p><p><span>10. 如申请直博生，需提交拟攻读博士学位的研究计划书；</span></p><p><span>11. 其他材料（论文发表、专利发明、各类获奖或资格证书等）。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/FUbvnBCEOQticJhzbOzLZRRAbkSXX014gwpicJm2nqGibfnSvKefEyPG5MkEdbyKskG0FiblFghCHHJMic393RtySbsoHOPZH55iaXqzOibs5Js1dw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 推免生须保证所提交全部材料真实、准确、完整，严禁弄虚作假及各类学术不端行为；</span></p><p><span>2. 推免招生录取的学科、校区、学制、学费、奖助及住宿等政策以当年招生简章和学科专业目录规定为准，如有疑问，可及时咨询；</span></p><p><span>3. 根据教育部相关规定，已被学校拟录取的推免生不得再报名参加当年全国硕士研究生招生考试；</span></p><p><span>4. 拟录取推免生应密切关注学校研究生招生信息网(网址：https://yjszs.ecnu.edu.cn)、微信公众号(华东师大研招)，研究院官网(https://iqspm.ecnu.edu.cn)、微信公众号（量子科学与精密测量研究院）以及研究院电话、邮件等通知，以便及时获知招生信息；</span></p><p><span>5. 相关工作调整、更新及未尽事宜，将另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>咨询及监督</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/FUbvnBCEOQss3efiaLPeDCcJFu4a6s7k2S0GrmzcBv2bjxK4OkgWV1Iw7oCnFpJHZaVg6xZkLRo5jYdwDcMgmssvFCf9siczMAmtlCOkeYwiaY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 招生信息咨询：</span></p><p><span>冯老师，18153096001（暑期轮休期间，请优先通过邮件方式咨询）</span></p><p><span>邮箱:</span></p><p><span><span>iqspm@phy.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>myfeng@phy.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span>2. 研究院推免招生工作坚持公平公正；若有举报，可具名向监督条线反映。</span></p><p><span>监督电话: </span><span><span>13916626138</span></span></p><p><span>电子邮箱:</span></p><p><span><span>yzjing@sist.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/FUbvnBCEOQvOEicF1ZsT7sIeicQvnPNkLoRsH0fMYsib0m5t49lMbY2UptForwKx1xTKbBUCbAt2lwjukVibLbbcoz5TBnslTE5jsLiavLhRjdz8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>量子科学与精密测量研究院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>欢迎扫描二维码</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>关注我们！</span></strong></p></section></section><